    "root": "BlockNode/00C7BJZVF8000",
    "text": "Filed against `terminusdb/terminusdb` as [#2509](https://github.com/terminusdb/terminusdb/issues/2509) (2026-08-26). Related: [#1147](https://github.com/terminusdb/terminusdb/issues/1147), [#1235](https://github.com/terminusdb/terminusdb/pull/1235)."
  },
